<j:jelly xmlns:j="jelly:core">
    <div>
        This plugin provides AI automated code review into the Jenkins build process and allows build agents to run as
        AI agents to check and review code with a highly-configurable extensible process to allow for specialized tools
        and other helpful procedures.
    </div>
</j:jelly>
